serum creatinine, eGFR trends, and blood pressure control over time.\n\n**Cautions / gaps**\nThis is supportive specialty-model output, not a diagnosis or guideline-grade recommendation on its own. If you want, I can turn this into a cleaner clinician-style checklist or a patient-friendly summary next.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e8434613da66f1e0169e9fcb9ecec81918da057c1e94adef1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1761,"output":215,"cacheRead":17024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19000,"cost":{"input":0.0044025,"output":0.003225,"cacheRead":0.004256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011883500000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776942263973,"responseId":"resp_0e8434613da66f1e0169e9fcb836e88191bd40c553de6ae436"}}
